        "content": "Love that idea 🌾💚  \n\nBefore we start, tell me a few things so I can tailor it:\n\n1. **Who are you in this roleplay?**\n   - A new farmer (tell me name, farm name, appearance, personality)?\n   - An existing Stardew character?\n   - Something unusual (witch, traveling merchant’s kid, secret wizard apprentice, etc.)?\n\n2. **Romance or no romance?**  \n   If yes, with whom? (Sebastian, Haley, Leah, Sam, Abigail, Shane, Elliott, Harvey, Alex, Maru, Penny, Emily, Krobus, someone else?)\n\n3. **Tone?**\n   - Cozy & wholesome 🌻  \n   - Dramatic & angsty 🌧️  \n   - Comedic chaos 🐔  \n   - Slow-burn romance 🔥  \n   - Slightly dark/mysterious 🌙  \n\n4. **Season to start in?** (Spring Year 1? Winter Year 3? Flower Dance? Stardew Valley Fair?)\n\nOnce you answer, I’ll open the scene and we’ll begin 🌾✨",
